<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">A long long time ago</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">I can still remember how</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">That music used to make me smile</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">And I knew if I had my chance</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">That I could make those people dance</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">And maybe they'd be happy for a while</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">But February made me shiver</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">With every paper I'd deliver</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">Bad news on the doorstep</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">I couldn't take one more step</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">I can't remember if I cried</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">When I read about his widowed bride</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">Something touched me deep inside</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uAsV5-Hv-7U">The day the music died</a></em></strong></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p>With thanks to the following:</p>
<p>Rounder &quot;Yurt Boi&quot; House<br />
Stallmantic<br />
DrMartens<br />
Woedenaz<br />
KindlyTurtleClem</p>
<p>This skip messes heavily with Roget's Class of 76 canon. If he'd like me to take it down I will do so at once.</p>
<p>The first image belongs to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404096); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404096&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1560803084" alt="Woedenaz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404096)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404096); return false;">Woedenaz</a></span>, and is used with their kind permission.<br />
The second image is from <a href="https://unsplash.com/photos/taKCAaRUVV8">here</a>, is CC-compliant, and belongs to JR Korpa.</p>

